ed91","position":{"commit_sha":"1a4a396f6b2e4fb15c0b976b1348230763ed6c9a","position":"1786500717003320001-7b243db5-71fa-4035-9cc6-d981fb31ed91"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"7f60ca92b461a541fd291153953a3b1ccc6d68c0626dce72da8f5177853e5a39","event_uuid":"7c02796f-4e1b-4142-9e25-5c117600724f","position":{"commit_sha":"9004239d156d24c77e4036a1b63ade7846772d03","position":"1786502449453669708-7c02796f-4e1b-4142-9e25-5c117600724f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"ec7bffb8ed654c3b03031b0b2408c39c309ba238c3c1a1d85e859a352a48426a","event_uuid":"cec9b8f4-443a-4d82-bc9e-4bf5ecc24d70","position":{"commit_sha":"372858a578480663d8450344b5f2aa1672570723","position":"1786503038283686001-cec9b8f4-443a-4d82-bc9e-4bf5ecc24d70"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-227_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"6f8df6b5-44f6-4ea4-b224-1eac4c95b0a7","comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Fix landed on main as 08918c7314 (Gerrit change 1608, LLM-Review +1 / Verified +1).\n\nRoot cause confirmed as triaged: `evals/eval.py::_live_solver` builds ONE PydanticAIRunner before any case fixture exists, so its `LLMConfig.repo_path` is the eval checkout; `runner._effective_config` substitutes only per-request model/limit tuning and preserves that base path, so an injected live runner's agentic filesystem + ticket tools searched the checkout instead of each disposable case repo.\n\nFix: `evals/eval_solver.py::_rerooted` rebuilds the injected PydanticAIRunner rooted at each disposable case store (preserving the offline model_override harness) and clears `tickets_path` so ticket tools read the fixture's own seeded store. Applied inside the `case_store` arm, so it covers completion-verifier, ticket-quality and spec-alignment. Scoped to the eval path — production gate config resolution is untouched, and FakeRunner (which reads no filesystem) passes through unchanged.\n\nTests: new parametrized contract in tests/unit/test_eval_solver.py builds the agent's OWN filesystem tools from the runner config handed to each op and asserts read_file('src/cli.py') returns the fixture content, not the checkout's; verified RED (3 failures: 'runner must be rooted at the case fixture') with the re-root line removed. Gates green: make lint, make typecheck, pytest tests/unit -k eval (202 passed), pytest tests/interfaces -k 'eval or mcp' (315 passed).","timestamp":1786503038283686001}],"created_at":1786274115987289001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"baf08b8b-5ffc-43cd-b0cd-03facfa80185","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"0707-59ae-7db6-489b"},{"link_uuid":"7c02796f-4e1b-4142-9e25-5c117600724f","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"98f9-b248-e2fd-4f2d"}],"description":"## Problem\nThe live `completion-verifier` standing eval constructs one PydanticAIRunner before entering its per-case disposable repositories. `eval_solver.run_case` correctly passes a per-case `repo_root`, but the explicit runner override retains its original `LLMConfig.repo_path`. `runner._effective_config` substitutes only the request model, so filesystem and ticket tools read the checkout instead of each case fixture.\n\n## Evidence\nA full live run had coverage 1.0 but epoch_pass `[False, False, False]`. Targeted complete cases searched `/Users/joeoakhart/rebar-debug-completion-9895` and cited `src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/completion-verifier.eval.yaml`; they did not see fixture files such as `src/cli.py` or `app/profile.py`. Operator-attested cases, which need no fixture code, passed. Code path: `src/rebar/llm/evals/eval.py::_live_solver` builds one runner; `src/rebar/llm/evals/eval_solver.py::run_case` creates the disposable repo; `src/rebar/llm/runner.py::_effective_config` preserves the runner base `repo_path`.\n\n## Plan\n- Add a RED eval-solver contract proving an explicitly injected reusable live-style runner reads each disposable case root.\n- Re-root the effective per-request config without weakening the run-wide budget/config floor or model override semantics.\n- Validate completion, ticket-quality, and spec-alignment disposable-store cases plus ordinary workflow runner reuse.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A deterministic test reproduces a completion eval reading the wrong checkout root before the fix.\n- [ ] Every agentic eval case reads its own disposable fixture repository and ticket store.\n- [ ] Existing per-step model substitution and run-wide floor semantics remain unchanged.\n- [ ] The full live `completion-verifier` standing eval passes its declared `at_least(2)` gate with coverage at least 0.8.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","98f9-b248-e2fd-4f2d"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"c06c6c2f-e0ba-469f-8c9d-c99001b859a9","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"ca47-e124-7462-44d0","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Standing completion eval reads the checkout instead of disposable fixture repos","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["78ea6d59-3fd0-4171-a5d6-a8c6cbd58e45","baf08b8b-5ffc-43cd-b0cd-03facfa80185","f80de824-5eae-4811-bcde-e336406d823a","c06c6c2f-e0ba-469f-8c9d-c99001b859a9","7b243db5-71fa-4035-9cc6-d981fb31ed91","7c02796f-4e1b-4142-9e25-5c117600724f","cec9b8f4-443a-4d82-bc9e-4bf5ecc24d70"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786503038283686002,"uuid":"36cf1456-f249-4fcd-848e-e906746ab8cc"}